## Overview

The **Interaction Limit** step allows you to configure whether a nudge can reappear after a customer dismisses it and define the interaction threshold at which it stops appearing.

This step includes two configuration options:

- **Show Again After Dismissal** — Determines whether a dismissed nudge can be displayed again.
- **Nudge Interaction Limit** — Defines the interaction threshold after which the nudge stops appearing.

